
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>S. Vigneshwaran | Mechanical Engineer</title>
<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #f4f4f4;
  color: #333;
}
.profile {
  max-width: 750px;
  margin: 40px auto;
  background: white;
  border-radius: 15px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 20px #aaa;
}
.header {
  background: #d60000;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 45px 20px;
}
.header h1 {
  font-size: 34px;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
.header p {
  font-size: 18px;
}
.content {
  padding: 30px;
}
h2 {
  color: #d60000;
  border-bottom: 2px solid #d60000;
  padding-bottom: 8px;
  margin-bottom: 15px;
}
section {
  margin-bottom: 25px;
}
ul {
  padding-left: 22px;
  line-height: 2;
}
footer {
  background: #222;
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 18px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="profile">

  <div class="header">
    <h1>S. VIGNESHWARAN</h1>
    <p>MECHANICAL ENGINEER</p>
    <p>Professional Profile</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content">

    <section>
      <h2>About Me</h2>
      <p>
        I am S. Vigneshwaran, a Mechanical Engineering
        professional interested in mechanical design,
        manufacturing, production and engineering technology.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Mechanical Engineering</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Technical Skills</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Mechanical Design</li>
        <li>AutoCAD</li>
        <li>Manufacturing Process</li>
        <li>Production Engineering</li>
        <li>Quality Control</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Career Objective</h2>
      <p>
        To build a successful career in the mechanical
        engineering field and contribute my technical
        knowledge and skills to an organization.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Contact Details</h2>
      <p>Name: S. Vigneshwaran</p>
      <p>Department: Mechanical Engineering</p>
      <p>Email: Your Email</p>
      <p>Phone: Your Mobile Number</p>
    </section>

  </div>

  <footer>
    © 2026 S. Vigneshwaran | Mechanical Engineer
